# vew_recipe data source

Reads one existing project-scoped recipe. Archived recipes remain visible when
VEW returns them; the data source never imports or changes a recipe.

Permission: project assignment and `clients/packaging/recipe.read`.

## Selectors

| Attribute | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `project_id` | string | Required VEW project identifier. |
| `recipe_id` | string | Required exact recipe identifier. |

## Computed attributes

`name`, `description`, `platform`, `architecture`, `os_version`, `status`,
`created_at`, `created_by`, `updated_at`, and `updated_by`. A missing exact
recipe produces an error.

```hcl
data "vew_recipe" "existing" {
  project_id = var.project_id
  recipe_id  = var.recipe_id
}

output "recipe_status" {
  value = data.vew_recipe.existing.status
}
```

